Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:08:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] cards v3.1: four-term gas yield in the barrel; gap bin
 fitted on its own rings

Gas barrel yield residuals 5-10% -> within errors (4-term even polynomial, still held inside
the fitted range). Barrel-endcap gap: per-photon s1 and the correlated term from the gap rings
(k fixed, equal weights), giving sigma_track ~2.3 mrad instead of the 1.7 mrad of the
neighbouring-bin fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
